OL,4,BCost of Man Utd hiring and firing      
OL,5,Bmanagers nears #100m                   
OL,6,GManchester United borrowed another     
OL,7,G#10m three days after confirming       
OL,8,GMauricio Pochettino as their new head  
OL,9,Gcoach.                                 
OL,11,FIn an extended Stock Market filing to  
OL,12,Fgo with their first-quarter financial  
OL,13,Fresults that were released on          
OL,14,FThursday, United said they would be    
OL,15,Fliable to pay #7.5m in compensation to 
OL,16,FUS Soccer to hire the Argentine.       
OL,18,FUnited announced Pochettino had agreed 
OL,19,Fa two-and-a-half-year deal on 13       
OL,20,FNovember. They borrowed #10m on 16     
OL,21,FNovember.                              
